    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_36ec3bc774fc1ed55756",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 79,
      "text": "# 1.2.2 多体系统动力学分析方法;",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c8f011c56cba856f7d12",
      "document_start": 80,
      "document_end": 112,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e0c45c04477dbfd8e5a2",
      "document_start": 114,
      "document_end": 169,
      "text": "多刚体系统动力学是古典的刚体力学、分析力学与现代电子计算机相结合的力学分支，其研究对象是由多个刚体组成的系统。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1c71f8a4178555461c9a",
      "document_start": 169,
      "document_end": 206,
      "text": "多刚体系统中最简单的情况——自由质点和少数多个刚体，是经典力学的研究内容。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_df48729432e20a1a3503",
      "document_start": 206,
      "document_end": 274,
      "text": "对于由多个刚体组成的复杂系统，理论上可以采用经典力学的方法，即以牛顿-欧拉法为代表的矢量力学方法和以拉格朗日方程法为代表的分析力学方法。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ff0d010cc4ab5030a80a",
      "document_start": 274,
      "document_end": 336,
      "text": "这种方法对于单刚体或者少数几个刚体组成的系统是可行的，但随着刚体数目的增加，方程复杂度成倍增长，寻求其解析解往往是不可能的。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_06252501bbb842951e3e",
      "document_start": 338,
      "document_end": 358,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c8bd8ab8697dafaef9ca",
      "document_start": 359,
      "document_end": 379,
      "text": "# 1.2.2 多体系统动力学分析方法;",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1ce9febc82f08562b77d",
      "document_start": 380,
      "document_end": 412,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_56788a5a2e8cc2a940ad",
      "document_start": 414,
      "document_end": 480,
      "text": "多刚体系统动力学就是为多个刚体组成的复杂系统的运动学和动力学分析建立适宜于计算机程序求解的数学模型，并寻求高效、稳定的数值求解方法。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0234f8618cfd902eb5d",
      "document_start": 480,
      "document_end": 520,
      "text": "由经典力学逐步发展形成的多刚体系统动力学，在发展过程中形成了各具特色的多个流派。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9d44afcbe3e9a74453ca",
      "document_start": 520,
      "document_end": 576,
      "text": "目前，已经形成了比较系统的理论方法，主要有牛顿-欧拉法、拉格朗日方程法、图论（R-W）方法、凯恩方法、变分方法。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_853d44da7e1d747fa0ca",
      "document_start": 578,
      "document_end": 598,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c692741fdbe633738fdd",
      "document_start": 599,
      "document_end": 619,
      "text": "# 1.2.2 多体系统动力学分析方法;",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0de0acbc52c3e3c28a89",
      "document_start": 620,
      "document_end": 652,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6aff278d49a3f7f62fa8",
      "document_start": 654,
      "document_end": 695,
      "text": "多柔体系统动力学是分析力学、连续介质力学、多刚体动力学、结构动力学交叉发展的必然。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_740dda898e03bd0b1448",
      "document_start": 695,
      "document_end": 765,
      "text": "多柔体系统动力学研究物体的变形和整体刚性运动的耦合问题，区别于多刚体系统动力学，多柔体系统含有柔性部件，变形不可忽略，逆运动学也是不确定的；",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f3deffd02d1709daa441",
      "document_start": 765,
      "document_end": 809,
      "text": "与传统的结构力学不同，柔体部件在自身变形运动的同时，在空间中也经历着大的刚性移动和转动。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_45cb557ad8b8eed1bad2",
      "document_start": 809,
      "document_end": 836,
      "text": "多柔体系统是一个时变、高度耦合和高度非线性的复杂系统。",
      "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97"
    }
  ],
