          "document_start": 414,
          "document_end": 480,
          "text": "多刚体系统动力学就是为多个刚体组成的复杂系统的运动学和动力学分析建立适宜于计算机程序求解的数学模型，并寻求高效、稳定的数值求解方法。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 414,
          "end": 480,
          "chunk_start": 414,
          "chunk_end": 480,
          "sentence_document_start": 414,
          "sentence_document_end": 480,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a0234f8618cfd902eb5d",
          "document_start": 480,
          "document_end": 520,
          "text": "由经典力学逐步发展形成的多刚体系统动力学，在发展过程中形成了各具特色的多个流派。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 480,
          "end": 520,
          "chunk_start": 480,
          "chunk_end": 520,
          "sentence_document_start": 480,
          "sentence_document_end": 520,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9d44afcbe3e9a74453ca",
          "document_start": 520,
          "document_end": 576,
          "text": "目前，已经形成了比较系统的理论方法，主要有牛顿-欧拉法、拉格朗日方程法、图论（R-W）方法、凯恩方法、变分方法。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 520,
          "end": 576,
          "chunk_start": 520,
          "chunk_end": 576,
          "sentence_document_start": 520,
          "sentence_document_end": 576,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_853d44da7e1d747fa0ca",
          "document_start": 578,
          "document_end": 598,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 578,
          "end": 598,
          "chunk_start": 578,
          "chunk_end": 598,
          "sentence_document_start": 578,
          "sentence_document_end": 598,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c692741fdbe633738fdd",
          "document_start": 599,
          "document_end": 619,
          "text": "# 1.2.2 多体系统动力学分析方法;",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 599,
          "end": 619,
          "chunk_start": 599,
          "chunk_end": 619,
          "sentence_document_start": 599,
          "sentence_document_end": 619,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0de0acbc52c3e3c28a89",
          "document_start": 620,
          "document_end": 652,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 620,
          "end": 652,
          "chunk_start": 620,
          "chunk_end": 652,
          "sentence_document_start": 620,
          "sentence_document_end": 652,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6aff278d49a3f7f62fa8",
          "document_start": 654,
          "document_end": 695,
          "text": "多柔体系统动力学是分析力学、连续介质力学、多刚体动力学、结构动力学交叉发展的必然。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 654,
          "end": 695,
          "chunk_start": 654,
          "chunk_end": 695,
          "sentence_document_start": 654,
          "sentence_document_end": 695,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_740dda898e03bd0b1448",
          "document_start": 695,
          "document_end": 765,
          "text": "多柔体系统动力学研究物体的变形和整体刚性运动的耦合问题，区别于多刚体系统动力学，多柔体系统含有柔性部件，变形不可忽略，逆运动学也是不确定的；",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 695,
          "end": 765,
          "chunk_start": 695,
          "chunk_end": 765,
          "sentence_document_start": 695,
          "sentence_document_end": 765,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f3deffd02d1709daa441",
          "document_start": 765,
          "document_end": 809,
          "text": "与传统的结构力学不同，柔体部件在自身变形运动的同时，在空间中也经历着大的刚性移动和转动。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 765,
          "end": 809,
          "chunk_start": 765,
          "chunk_end": 809,
          "sentence_document_start": 765,
          "sentence_document_end": 809,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_45cb557ad8b8eed1bad2",
          "document_start": 809,
          "document_end": 836,
          "text": "多柔体系统是一个时变、高度耦合和高度非线性的复杂系统。",
          "section_id": "section_330c4a906a97",
          "start": 809,
          "end": 836,
          "chunk_start": 809,
          "chunk_end": 836,
          "sentence_document_start": 809,
          "sentence_document_end": 836,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
